#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Guide"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Welcome to &kamoso;!"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kamoso; is a great program to use your webcam to take pictures or make "
"videos. This guide will help you to use &kamoso; once you have installed it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On launching &kamoso;, it displays this window with buttons at the bottom:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switch to <guibutton>Shoot</guibutton> mode to take one picture"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Switch to <guibutton>Burst</guibutton> mode and take continuously pictures "
"until you stop by clicking the middle button again"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switch to <guibutton>Record</guibutton> mode to record a video"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start or stop taking pictures or recording a video"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show gallery"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pictures and videos are numbered consecutively and saved automatically in "
"the <guilabel>Captures directory</guilabel> defined in the settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing Captures"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To view and menage your captured pictures or videos click the "
"<guibutton>Show gallery</guibutton> button. In the context context menu for "
"each entry in the gallery you find actions to manage them:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem> to view your captures in the associated "
"applicaton."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to delete pictures and videos open the captures folder in the "
"filemanager."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next actions allow you to upload captures to the Internet or send them "
"to a contact or device."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <guimenuitem>Save as</guimenuitem> to copy the complete content of the "
"gallery to a new folder."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>Show settings</guibutton> button to open the settings "
"panel. Click the button again to hide the settings panel."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to change the folder where &kamoso; saves pictures and videos, "
"change the <guilabel>Captures directory</guilabel> at the top."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable <guibutton>Use flash</guibutton> to highligt the window before taking "
"photos."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the sliders you can modify camera settings like brightness, hue, "
"contrast, saturation and gamma."
msgstr ""

